* Sun Mar 15 2026 Weilin Tong <tongweilin@linux.alibaba.com> [6.6.102-5.3_rc2%%DIST%%]
- bpf: Fix compare error in function retval_range_within (Xu Kuohai)
- bpf, lsm: Add check for BPF LSM return value (Xu Kuohai)
- bpf: enforce precise retval range on program exit (Andrii Nakryiko)
- bpf: enforce exact retval range on subprog/callback exit (Andrii Nakryiko)
- bpf: rearrange bpf_func_state fields to save a bit of memory (Andrii Nakryiko)
- anolis: pstore: fix memleak in loaded_backend_show() (Yuanhe Shu)
- mm/khugepaged: free empty xa_nodes when rollbacks in collapse_file (Matthew Wilcox)
- anolis: PCI: Check rom header and data structure addr before accessing (Guixin Liu)
- anolis: PCI: Check rom image addr at every step (Guixin Liu)
- anolis: sched: ignore deleyed dequeue se when skip idle se (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: sched: fix task_struct leak of ID_PUSH_EXPELLEE (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: sched: fix absolute expel and push expellee doesn't work sometimes (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: sched: continue to pull tasks if we haven't pull non-idle tasks (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: sched: avoid voluntary context switch within RCU read-side critical section (Cruz Zhao)
- anolis: sched: prevent SCHED_IDLE tasks from starving (Cruz Zhao)
- mm: shmem: avoid unpaired folio_unlock() in shmem_swapin_folio() (Kemeng Shi)
- mm: prevent poison consumption when splitting THP (Qiuxu Zhuo)
- mm/rmap: fix soft-dirty and uffd-wp bit loss when remapping zero-filled mTHP subpage to shared zeropage (Lance Yang)
- mm/thp: fix MTE tag mismatch when replacing zero-filled subpages (Lance Yang)
- mm: hugetlb: avoid soft lockup when mprotect to large memory area (Yang Shi)
- mm/khugepaged: fix the address passed to notifier on testing young (Wei Yang)
- mm: shmem: avoid unpaired folio_unlock() in shmem_swapin_folio() (Kemeng Shi)
- mm: convert __do_fault() to use a folio (Matthew Wilcox (Oracle))
- mm, swap: avoid over reclaim of full clusters (Kairui Song)
- mm/shmem: fix THP allocation and fallback loop (Kairui Song)
- mm/shmem, swap: improve cached mTHP handling and fix potential hang (Kairui Song)
- mm/shmem, swap: fix softlockup with mTHP swapin (Kairui Song)
- mm/filemap: use filemap_end_dropbehind() for read invalidation (Jens Axboe)
- mm/filemap: gate dropbehind invalidate on folio !dirty && !writeback (Jens Axboe)
- anolis: mm: clear I_KIDLED_YOUNG synchronously when shrink_slab (zhongjiang-ali)
- anolis: conditionally revert "virtio_pci: Support surprise removal of virtio pci device" (Tianchen Ding)
- anolis: virtio-net: Revert "net: virtio_net: implement exact header length guest feature" (Xuan Zhuo)
- anolis: writeback: fix race in insert_memcg_blkcg_link() (Ferry Meng)
- ext4: fix incorrect function name in comment (Baolin Liu)
- fs/ntfs3: Equivalent transition from page to folio (Konstantin Komarov)
- hostfs: Fix the NULL vs IS_ERR() bug for __filemap_get_folio() (ZhangPeng)
- buffer: fix unintended successful return (Matthew Wilcox (Oracle))
- ext4: add __GFP_NOWARN to GFP_NOWAIT in readahead (Hugh Dickins)
- ext4: add ext4_sb_bread_nofail() helper function for ext4_free_branches() (Baokun Li)
- anolis: virtfuse: always bind fc to init_user_ns for virtfuse (Jingbo Xu)
- mm: fix arithmetic for bdi min_ratio (Jingbo Xu)
- mm: fix arithmetic for max_prop_frac when setting max_ratio (Jingbo Xu)

